--- !u!114 &1492435401
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1492435395}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: eb23d517141e43640a4698520a546eea, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::GameFlowManager
  player: {fileID: 959743098}
  daffodil: {fileID: 223525519}
  windmill: {fileID: 450741102}
  puzzle: {fileID: 2032331158}
  mushroomField: {fileID: 1752098837}
  tornado: {fileID: 564842262}
  npcManager: {fileID: 2032331156}
  obelisk: {fileID: 1329091256}
  bunker: {fileID: 0}
  newLocationViewpoint: {fileID: 1577339459}
  cameraRig: {fileID: 1803233067}
  hud: {fileID: 1766708272}
  dialogue: {fileID: 1492435398}
  video: {fileID: 1492435396}
  lifeSupport: {fileID: 1492435400}
  checkpoints: {fileID: 1492435399}
  introClip: {fileID: 32900000, guid: c3228e5d10543c04a9508217df2ee954, type: 3}
  outroClip: {fileID: 0}
  bunkerMusic: {fileID: 0}
  debugStartPhase: 0
  scanTutorialSeconds: 1
  sandboxSecondsBeforeObelisk: 75
  tornadoIntroHoldSeconds: 8
  tornadoStrikeHoldSeconds: 12
  windmillHealthAfterStrike: 0.25
  obeliskCoreTornadoIntensity: 1.6
  calmTornadoIntensity: 0.75
  revealSeconds: 4
  lifeSupportFloorOnRestore: 0.6
  scanTutorialLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Systems up. Barely. Welcome to Mars, Eschropita.
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: I'm your scanner, your map, and apparently your bitch. Hold V to scan.
  scanDoneLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: See? Everything that matters lights up. Everything else is dust.
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: "\u2026Something's coming. Small. Fungal.Maybe martians?"
  mycariArrivedLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: A Mycari. Local. They don't talk, they sing. It wants you to follow it.
  demoStartLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Watch the mushrooms. It's showing you a melody. you need to mimic it
  puzzleStartLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Your turn. Walk up to a mushroom and press E. Mimic the tune. Please dont fail
      FFS.
  puzzleFailToasts:
  - 'Daffodil: Wrong. Again.'
  - "Daffodil: That was\u2026 creative. Again."
  - 'Daffodil: Watch the mushrooms. Then press the mushrooms. In that order.'
  puzzleSuccessLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Fine. You can hum. Congratulations, you're bilingual in mushroom.
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Look, it's heading for the windmill. I think thats a repairer
  windmillRepairedLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Windmill's back up. That thing powers our life support, so keep it that
      way.
  tornadoIntroLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Pressure drop. Storm cell forming. Dust tornado.
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Stay out of its path. It'll shred you and anything you care about.
  tornadoGoneLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: It's gone. For now. They come back.
  tornadoStrikeLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: "It's turning. It's heading for the windmill\u2014"
  windmillStruckLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Power's down. Life support runs on that windmill.
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Find a Fixer, the green ones, and get it running. Breakers, the red ones,
      only know how to take things apart.
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Scan with V to tell them apart. Scanning drains me, so don't hold it for
      fun.
  lifeSupportLowLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Life support at a quarter. Just saying.
  gameOverLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: "\u2026and that's zero. Rolling back to the last checkpoint. Do better."
  obeliskFoundLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: New reading. A structure, shielded, old. Older than the colony. The Mycari
      avoid it.
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: The shield is energy. Breakers could take it down. Bring a few.
  obeliskShieldBrokenLines:
  - speaker: OBELISK
    text: "\u2026WE WERE THE WIND. WE WERE THE WIND BEFORE YOU NAMED IT."
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Well. That's ominous.
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: Those shards hold a charge. Pick them up. We can build a shield around
      the windmill with them. Press E at the windmill.
  obeliskCoreLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: "Shield's holding. But the storms are getting worse, and that thing is\u2026
      singing. Louder every minute."
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: I think it's the source. Bring Breakers. Take it all the way down.
  obeliskDestroyedLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: "It's quiet. The wind's\u2026 normal. There's a hatch under the rubble."
  bunkerLines:
  - speaker: TERMINAL
    text: 'SURVEY OUTPOST 7. LOG 1: The wind sings at night. The obelisk answers.'
  - speaker: TERMINAL
    text: 'LOG 2: We built the windmills to drown it out. It grew louder.'
  - speaker: TERMINAL
    text: 'LOG 3: The Mycari know something. We should have listened.'
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: "\u2026Listen."
  newLocationLines:
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: The Mycari are playing something new. Over there. Look.
  finalReportLines:
  - speaker: FIXER
    text: "\u266A The windmill turns. The dome breathes. We patched what you broke
      and what the wind broke. \u266A"
  - speaker: BREAKER
    text: "\u266A The stone that sang is silent. Its shards keep your wind. We are
      not sorry. \u266A"
  - speaker: WANDERER
    text: "\u266A We walked far. The valley past the ridge is green. Follow, when
      you're ready. \u266A"
  - speaker: Daffodil
    text: That's the report. Green valley, silent stone, running windmill. Not bad
      for a first week, Eschropita.
